{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_05",
  "title": "货与人",
  "storyCode": "IW-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9aa764cfb7e64b0e33d30b39e33fd32a14e1dded6a2796d3904f9496e81b0fe6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山上的风，总是清爽的。\n一个清爽的早晨，总是适合解决一些不清不楚的事情。\n山间小镇刚起炊烟，春雪未散，一老一小，相顾无言。\n只听远方一声击锣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "等你很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......嘁，这家伙......阿灯，先不要轻举妄动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "我见过你，嗯，原来是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "的确是出人意料，一个雷姆必拓人，一个从一开始就悄悄蛰伏在尚蜀的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "我可听不懂啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "阿灯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "什——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "套索？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你把这些眠兽训练得不错，如果是寻常人，此刻就该倒栽葱扎在地里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（不仅能立刻发现背后的陷阱，还能稳稳把绳索踩在脚下......这老头......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "别担心，我不难为你一个姑娘家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你知道你怀里的那只酒盏，是什么东西吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......我不关心，也不在乎。问太多的赏金猎人，都是新手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "那就要怪你自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "别这么得意！小帽！钻头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "既然不知道是什么，就老老实实把东西交出来，不要白白遭人利用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你、你竟然对小帽——！你自找的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......无头箭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（用、用手抓住了？这个距离！？我可是才给弩换过弦的——！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "念在你不愿意伤人性命的份上，我给你一个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "把这酒盏给我，然后告诉你背后的人：慎行，忌私。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "哼，你知道我背后是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "知不知道不重要，重要的是，我能在这条路上堵住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......我凭什么听你的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你没得选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你自己也许逃得掉，但你总不忍心看见，自己饲养的这些小畜生遭了殃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你威胁我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你有些身手，可除了摆弄弓弩，也没啥功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "大可不必敬酒不吃吃罚酒，混江湖，是要靠眼力识人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......确实，那个人也没和我说，会有你这样的高手来碍事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "如果我拜托一个人去做一件危险的事，那我也多半不会全盘托出的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "外乡人，一份工作而已，何必搭上身家性命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "把盏给我，我以镖局的名义担保，那人许你多少钱财，我们双倍奉上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......哈，本来就是亏本买卖，义务劳动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "算是帮朋友忙吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "原来你这样的荒野流寇，也愿意为朋友两肋插刀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你好像对我们有点意见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......没有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "生意做久了，贵人多了，朋友也就少了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "那你就老老实实回去做生意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "是啊，山上的生意是最好做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "这三山十七峰几百条山道，哪条道上没有供人歇脚休憩的茶馆驿站，哪条道上......没有我们的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "望姑娘知晓轻重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你还真不把我放在眼里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "虽然正面开战不是我的风格，但是都被挑衅到这个份上了......对吧，小家伙们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（雷姆必拓语）让这个老家伙知道厉害！我们摸爬滚打这么多年，也不是吃干饭的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "执迷不悟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "若是如此，那就得罪——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哪怕有第三个人站在一旁，他也绝对看不清这一步，是怎么踏上前来的。\n只因为这个人擅长走路，擅长爬山。他每天抬步踏步的次数，实在是太多太多。\n一声脆响，地上，青砖碎裂，身前，烟尘蒙蒙，眼旁，是一根朴素无奇的竹木扁担，微微发青。\n远方，又一声击锣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "——怎、怎么......这个人是从哪里......啊，阿灯，别怕，钻头！快到我这里......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你终于上山了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "所以我来找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "该来的总要来。躲是躲不完的。你又何必这么着急？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "喂，小女娃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（他的动作——这根木条是叫扁担来着？他刚才做了什么......把石砖地拍得粉碎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你认得他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那就是你们之间有什么麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "我们之间只站着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "说的对，那我就是你的麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "事办完了，我会去找你。但不是现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......小女娃，和你手里护着的玩意，有关系？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......啊......是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你我私仇，别扯上这件大事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "多大的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "百姓安危，士卒存亡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......自从那年雨夜之后，我很少听你有这样的语气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是啊。你怎么会是个恶人呢。一个侠义心肠的刀客，一个本分做人的掌柜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "那你就让开——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "——可我正知道你是这样一个人，所以你不来见我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你不见我，我去找你，也没有结果。所以我也没有下过山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那如果......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......啊！你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "还给我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......十年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "十年前，你就是为了护这只酒盏......看着我儿子死于非命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......尚冢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "小女娃，这没你什么事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你趁我不注意抢了我的货，还敢说没我事了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "这货本来也不是你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "尚冢，你昏头了吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "没你什么事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "尚冢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "滚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......嘁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你们最好记住......我一定会把东西抢回来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......郑清钺。你的刀呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "在家里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "哦。在家里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那年雨夜，走镖路上，共牺牲了十几号人。其中有一个儿子，一个父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "儿子姓尚，是我的儿子。父亲姓杜，是杜遥夜的亲爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "所以你就不戴刀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "天大的笑话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......你恨我到现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我不恨你，我知道你不是故意的，责任在你，错不在你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "“先救货，再救人”，哼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "可货没了，人也没了，难道还不许我怨你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我必须向你讨个说法，否则我活不下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......我答应你。酒盏给我。你知道，这只酒盏牵扯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我不知道。当年他为这只酒盏而死，今天，我要拿这只酒盏给他陪葬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我在山上等你，等你去取刀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......慎师傅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "嗯？你们怎么先来了？我刚打算去梁府找你们哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "鲤小子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "那只酒盏被偷了，鲤先生让我们来找您来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "他有交代过什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......他让你们来找我，却没让你们先去找那梁大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "你们分明是从梁府出来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "呃......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......唉。没让你们找梁洵，说明他心底里已经知道了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "人精，人精，确实是人精。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "太合叔，回来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "以她身份而言，礼数周到，名副其实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "愿意演这番礼数周到，说明还有斡旋余地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "不论她本人做何动作，有何居心。太傅手谕在此，作不得假。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "她是个聪明人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "我既以官身拜访，她当有所觉察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "如今两方都如劲弓满弦，一触即发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "唯有在惹出更多口舌非议之前，了结事端。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "如果真的要让所有人相信，我们的选择能让大炎永除后患，那我们自然得依那四个字——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "——光明磊落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
